{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/WelcomeBanner_Lamp_MidnightSouvenirs.gif?t=1747139067\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have just inherited a grand yet forsaken Victorian estate\u2014but something lurks within its halls. As you explore its shadowed corridors, you\u2019ll uncover lost artifacts, arcane relics, and cryptic puzzles that guard the secrets of its past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/features.png?t=1747139067\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/star_small.png?t=1747139067\" /> Find  unique artifacts for your otherworldly visitors in need</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/star_small.png?t=1747139067\" /> Solve the puzzles of the mansion to unravel its secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/star_small.png?t=1747139067\" /> Discover  hidden rooms and filled with untold stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/star_small.png?t=1747139067\" /> Mingle with the magical locals, touched by eldritch forces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/Hidden_headline.png?t=1747139067\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/HiddenObject.gif?t=1747139067\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search through beautifully hand-drawn rooms filled with hidden objects, everything from ordinary antiques to eldritch artifacts. Expand your collection with every object you find and discover the mansion\u2019s dark history piece by piece.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/headline_magicPuzzles.png?t=1747139067\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/puzzle_01.gif?t=1747139067\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve engaging puzzles infused with the arcane that will unlock sealed doors, revealing chambers untouched for decades. Take all the time you need finding the solution and enjoy the reveal of hidden pathways that put your curiosity to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/unlock_rooms.png?t=1747139067\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/exploration_01.gif?t=1747139067\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you unlock hidden chambers and follow the trail of clues, you'll uncover the intriguing\u2014and sometimes strange\u2014history behind the estate. Let your curiosity guide you through a world where every corner tells a tale.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/Meet_Locals_GIF.gif?t=1747139067\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are not alone in this Lovecraftian tale. The locals whisper about the house\u2019s  legacy, while enigmatic visitors appear with peculiar pleas. Engage in dialogs, piece together their fragmented stories, and uncover the fate of those who came before you. But beware\u2014some truths are better left forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/locals_frames.png?t=1747139067\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/FishStatue_Wishlist.png?t=1747139067\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623230?t=1747139067","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3623230?t=1747139067","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/80e3128726dfa17db8132f0a164650fb0c0ff620/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747139067","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/80e3128726dfa17db8132f0a164650fb0c0ff620/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747139067","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623230/extras/WelcomeBanner_Lamp_MidnightSouvenirs.gif?t=1747139067\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have just inherited a grand yet forsaken Victorian estate\u2014but something lurks within its halls. As you explore its shadowed corridors, you\u2019ll uncover lost artifacts, arcane relics, and cryptic puzzles that guard the secrets of its past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor